  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味と　酸味が　強い　調味料。トマトを　中心に　数種類の原料を　加工し　作られている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛과 신맛이 강한 조미료. 토마토를 중심으로 여러 종류의 원료를 가공해서 만든다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味和酸味強勁的調味料。由以番茄為主的數種原料加工製作而成。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très acide et salé. Un certain nombre d’ingrédients entre dans sa préparation, mais c’est la tomate qui lui donne sa saveur si particulière.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein sehr salziges sowie säuerliches Würzmittel, das aus einer Vielzahl an Zutaten hergestellt wird, wobei jedoch Tomaten die klar dominante Komponente bilden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ácido y salado a la vez, este condimento está hecho a partir de tomates y otros ingredientes procesados.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto salato e aspro. Si prepara con una base di Pomodori a cui vengono aggiunti di diversi altri ingredienti.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment with very salty and tart flavor. While a number of other ingredients go into its signature flavor, the noble tomato is its heart and soul.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "塩味と　酸味が　強い　調味料。トマトを　中心に　数種類の原料を　加工し　作られている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
